<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<worksheet>
    <title>Problem 30 - Written Homework - MTH 204</title>

    <exercise>
        <statement>
            <p>
                This final homework exercise is a good studying tool for the final exam.
                Throughout the semester, we've used memes to explain topics in linear algebra.
                Here is a google slide deck with some of those memes: <url href="https://gvsu.edu/s/3Vd"></url>.
                Pick 4 of the memes from the slide deck and explain them. </p>

            <p>
               Each meme explanation should 
                
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                           include the number of the meme
                        </p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                           be 4-5 complete sentences
                        </p>
                    </li>

                    <li>
                        <p>
                          answer the following questions  
                        </p>
                    
                    </li>
                    <li>
                    <ol>
                        <li>
                            <p>
                                What topic in linear algebra does this relate to? (You might use a chapter title
                                or section title from the textbook.)
                            </p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <p>
                                What is the math behind the meme? Think of explaining to someone 
                                in a different linear algebra class who has seen the content before this topic,
                                but not this topic, what they need to know to understand the meme.
                            </p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <p>
                                Why is the meme funny? (Or, if you don't find it funny, what is intended to be the joke?)
                            </p>
                        </li>

                    </ol>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </p>
        </statement>
    </exercise>
</worksheet>